<title>FINLAND: LONG HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>LONG HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The long Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose one basis-point to 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 19 fix	  March 18 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.07 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.18 pct		3.17 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.32 pct		3.29 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.48 pct		3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
